<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060C00QX" category="C" type-id="300EZ" name-id="442OH-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1201/51</dtccode>
<dtcname>Engine System Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060C00QX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00004GG00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>When an EFI system malfunction (check engine warning light on) is input, this code is output and the VSC warning light comes on. (VSC system is normal)</ptxt>
<ptxt>While the EFI system malfunction is present, TRC and VSC control are prohibited as a fail-safe.</ptxt>
<ptxt>When the signal from the EFI system returns to normal, the warning light and fail-safe are cancelled and the DTC is not stored.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.44in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.84in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.80in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1201/51</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine malfunction signal condition continues for 1 seconds or more</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060C00QX_02" type-id="51" category="05">
